{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778970/extras/sdfsd.png?t=1748539103\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunters of Idlearth</strong> is an idle game where you manage your team of hunters as you progress through different stages and complete missions. All of this happens in the corner of your screen, allowing you to go about your daily tasks on your desktop while the game continues.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Included in this demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 monsters to hunt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 boss monsters to hunt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">11 quests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunt Monsters:</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778970/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748539103\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete hunting missions to earn prestige points and make your hunters even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress through Different Stages:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage has a unique probability of spawning various monsters. As you advance, you\u2019ll uncover these probabilities, which will help you decide where to focus your efforts when completing missions. But beware: difficulty increases with each stage! You can choose to stay on a stage to farm monsters and gather resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778970/extras/222.png?t=1748539103\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deal with Defeat:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your team is completely wiped out, you'll return to the first stage. This can be a good opportunity to select a later stage to &quot;lock&quot; and farm, giving you the chance to gather more resources and better prepare for your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778970/extras/33333.gif?t=1748539103\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose Your Skills:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start without any usable abilities, but as you progress, you\u2019ll unlock and evolve different attributes to enhance your powers. Choose wisely which skills to develop, as they will help you adapt to the increasing challenges of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778970/extras/gifattributes.gif?t=1748539103\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adjust Your Screen</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different screen positioning options. Ultrawide support! (both vertical and horizontal).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778970/extras/imasssge.png?t=1748539103\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778970?t=1748539103","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778970?t=1748539103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778970/fa68be06acda5e353d06fbbd000896ebdc3253e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748539103","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778970/fa68be06acda5e353d06fbb